---
source: tests/sync/write_cargo_toml.rs
expression: "apply(cargo, &patch)"
---
## Input

```toml
[package]
name = "x"
version = "0.1"
[features]
node = ["dep:napi"]
```

## Patch

```
deps:
  - napi@3 require_features=["node"]
```

## Output

```toml
[package]
name = "x"
version = "0.1"
[features]
node = ["dep:napi"]

[dependencies]
napi = { version = "3", optional = true }
```
